                <pb facs="0326" n="244" sameAs="frus:frus1911/pg244"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 862.413St4/24.</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The American Ambassador to the Secretary of
                        State.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Embassy</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Berlin</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1911-05-30"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">May 30,
                    1911</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>The German Emperor is agreeable to the appointment of Hon. Richard Bartholdt as
                    the special representative of the President to present the statue of Gen. Von
                    Steuben.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hill.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
